# PUBLIC build-time config for the Cloudflare Pages production build.
# Vite inlines VITE_* at build time. These two values are PUBLIC by design:
# the anon key is meant to live in the browser, and Row-Level Security in
# Postgres is what actually protects data. Committing them keeps the build
# self-contained (no dependency on the Cloudflare dashboard env UI).
#
# The SECRET service_role key is NOT here — it lives only in the gitignored
# root .env, used by the Go importer.
